1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,200
The Four Seasons with Mimo!

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:12,165
Mimo: Hi friends! There are four seasons in a year: spring, summer, fall and winter. Let's visit each one!

3
00:00:14,665 --> 00:00:20,016
Mimo: In spring, flowers start to grow, and baby birds hatch from their eggs!

4
00:00:20,316 --> 00:00:23,757
Lulu: Spring smells like flowers! Sniff, sniff!

5
00:00:24,057 --> 00:00:25,644
Mimo: Can you say spring?

6
00:00:32,744 --> 00:00:38,144
Mimo: In summer, the sun is hot and bright. We go to the beach and swim!

7
00:00:38,444 --> 00:00:40,618
Bruno: And we eat ice cream to stay cool!

8
00:00:42,518 --> 00:00:43,940
Mimo: Can you say summer?

9
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:55,395
Mimo: In fall, the leaves change color. Red, orange and yellow! Then they fall down from the trees.

10
00:00:55,695 --> 00:00:57,851
Pip: Wheee! Look at all the leaves falling!

11
00:01:00,151 --> 00:01:01,601
Mimo: Can you say fall?

12
00:01:05,701 --> 00:01:11,778
Mimo: In winter, it's cold and snowy! We wear coats and mittens, and build snowmen!

13
00:01:13,678 --> 00:01:17,431
Bruno: Brrr! Winter is cold! Can I have some hot cocoa?

14
00:01:17,731 --> 00:01:19,274
Mimo: Can you say winter?

15
00:01:21,174 --> 00:01:24,621
Mimo: Let's say the four seasons together! Ready?

16
00:01:24,921 --> 00:01:25,726
Lulu: Spring!

17
00:01:26,526 --> 00:01:27,021
Bruno: Summer!

18
00:01:27,821 --> 00:01:28,613
Pip: Fall!

19
00:01:29,413 --> 00:01:30,293
Mimo: Winter!

20
00:01:31,893 --> 00:01:36,246
Mimo: And then it's spring again! Around and around the seasons go!

21
00:01:36,546 --> 00:01:38,627
Bruno: Which season has the most snacks?

22
00:01:38,927 --> 00:01:42,612
Mimo: All of them, Bruno! Bye bye, friends!
